  dialogues:
  - name: Leaifa
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9d7b3aba127390f4092ce7e668c7114b, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - Finally. Took you long enough.
  - name: Rautia
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: aa28b24cb0c23874d91590d7d9051a37, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - We have only been waiting a couple minutes.
  - name: Leaifa
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9d7b3aba127390f4092ce7e668c7114b, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - Whatever. What are we doing again?
  - name: Denali
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 37666a48d1d431849a0bbda42fd7b28e, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - Sorry for the wait.
    - We want to find a heating element. We should be able to get one from a radiator.
  - name: Leaifa
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9d7b3aba127390f4092ce7e668c7114b, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - "Great, Let\u2019s get to it."
  - name: Tutorial
    portrait: {fileID: -583743315, guid: 9eb1f13c449026d43b777a12a3cc6f75, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - Left-click on a character or their portrait in the upper left corner to select
      which character to control.
    - Press the All button to move all characters together.
